{"ts": 0.139048, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mcd: moving\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mcd\u001b[0m changes your current folder.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[92mcd /tmp\u001b[0m       \u001b[90m# go to /tmp\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m           \u001b[90m# confirm you got there\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcd\u001b[0m            \u001b[90m# your home folder, outside this practice area\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcd ~\u001b[0m          \u001b[90m# also your home folder (~ is its short name)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcd -\u001b[0m          \u001b[90m# come back to where you were\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcd ..\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# go up one level (to the parent folder)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 480}
{"ts": 0.139152, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[92mcd..\u001b[0m with no space is a different word; bash cannot find it.\r\n\u001b[91mStages 1 and 2 start every practice prompt in\u001b[0m /var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-vsjmn_82\u001b[0m\u001b[91m.\u001b[0m\r\nLater stages start in a stage folder inside it. If you wander off,\r\n\u001b[92mcd /var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-vsjmn_82\u001b[0m brings you back.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try \u001b[92mcd ..\u001b[93m, \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[93m, then \u001b[92mcd -\u001b[93m, then \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 491}
