{"ts": 0.200264, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 1 of 3   What does \u001b[92mcd ..\u001b[0m do?\r\n", "len": 52}
{"ts": 0.200381, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "it lists files\n", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.200431, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m it lists files\r\n", "len": 45}
{"ts": 0.217529, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[91mnot quite.\u001b[0m \u001b[90mhint:\u001b[0m Lesson 2.3: the two dots are the name of one particular other folder.\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 134}
